This repository redistributes third-party data under its own licences, unchanged in
content, in data/raw/, and derived task files built from it in data/*.jsonl.gz and
results/. The full licence texts are in data/licenses/.

- MBPP (Austin et al., 2021, "Program Synthesis with Large Language Models"), as
  published at huggingface.co/datasets/Muennighoff/mbpp.
  data/raw/mbpp.jsonl - Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International.
  data/licenses/MBPP-CC-BY-4.0.txt

- HumanEval (Chen et al., 2021, "Evaluating Large Language Models Trained on Code"),
  github.com/openai/human-eval, converted from parquet to JSONL.
  data/raw/humaneval.jsonl - MIT, Copyright (c) OpenAI.
  data/licenses/HumanEval-MIT.txt

- EvalPlus / HumanEval+ (Liu et al., 2023, "Is Your Code Generated by ChatGPT Really
  Correct?"), github.com/evalplus/evalplus, converted to gzipped JSONL.
  data/raw/humanevalplus.jsonl.gz - Apache License 2.0.
  data/licenses/EvalPlus-Apache-2.0.txt

Changes made to the data: format conversion only (parquet to JSONL, gzip). The derived
task files add injected single-point mutations of the reference solutions and generated
test inputs.

The mutation operators and dataset loaders are adapted from
github.com/hammasbuilds/mbpp-false-accepts (MIT, same author).
